    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "miyuki",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115947912430069172930/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIGhjwGvlrCZaaDabAtlKxz0-Bh4l-JaBWol92Kdpma-UIRoQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I am extremely satisfied with the haircut I received from Denise! Her technique is truly excellent. I greatly appreciate the meticulous attention she paid to every detail.\n\nThe staff at Kalypso were also incredibly friendly, and the whole salon was just overflowing with a happy, welcoming atmosphere.I also want to thank the entire Kalypso team for their kindness. The atmosphere in the shop was simply joyful.",
        "time": 1763587917,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ayesah M",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112518743467586936960/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJLJLTWx9HQaXsQwsqu5izR7huCjyPasQxuF_Af9MxCTnZnOA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Just wanted to share that we tried Kalypso Spa for the first time for haircuts for me and my daughter, and we will definitely be coming back. Aziza made the whole experience so enjoyable — she really listens and delivers. Thank you, Aziza, for making us look and feel even prettier. We appreciate you!",
        "time": 1764652398,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kacey Hrynkiw",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113108725757871829182/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXnWSBO390Cs2tE9O5QZu4BFbKWXgoaaUvIcYYTmzvZnmzVm8Aq=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "A lovely upscale space, with a cozy vibe. An attentive receptionist, a small coffee counter for your espresso needs. A couch & lounge waiting area. So many well chosen products on display, including some high quality clothing. Treatment selections range from relaxation to luxury. Easy to find & ample parking. Highly recommend.",
        "time": 1713322901,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Alyssa Tatulescu",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117917013331863717827/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-1LcBU8_9nVeo-vCszO4hv8UzPpH3Gc3ZC20E5dlKgMfe410=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I went to get a blowout and honestly I was nervous because I have curly hair and I feel like I never get the results I want, Maddy was amazing and she knew how to work with curly hair and gave me exactly what I imagined great service definitely recommend to book with Maddy if you have curly hair or any hair type! I’ll definitely be back and I would  trust her for a haircut and colouring as well",
        "time": 1765341849,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Israel",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111149712553631888724/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKFpi1a0_WNXJDxYua4t_s7kGQPJ19R7u6-GEAcjxSwRKRUvQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "My wife was so disappointed. She paid in advance,you must pay in advance!!!! Which is wrong to begin. She said that there were no mirrors to watch what the colourist was doing. My wife was so upset after she left because no one listened to her. They did a cheap and fast job for $300. The stylist said this is how we do it. My wife was upset. The manager lady came in for a minute and then left with her kids. The receptionist seem to be happy that my wife was upset. $300 bill I had to bring her to  another place to get it fixed.  Don’t pay in Advance because he already have your money. The manager lady don’t care at all. The receptionist are happy if you’re upset.",
        "time": 1759628862,
        "translated": false
      }
